<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle steady-up $1  - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle steady-up $1  - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady to $1.00 per cwt higher, compared to Monday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 500-600 lbs 78.50-85.50; 600-700 lbs 72.50-78.50; 700-800 lbs 73.00-80.50; 800-900 lbs 69.00-75.25, including 21 head 896 lbs 75.25. Holsteins - Large 2 500-600 lbs 11 head 543 lbs 65.50; 700-800 lbs 59.50- 61.00.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 66.00-70.00; 700-800 lbs 63.50-67.00. Cattle and Calves Receipts - 700</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
